#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:251
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(buka di tab baru)"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:199
msgid "Send this to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Kirim ini ke dukungan Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:201
msgid "This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it."
msgstr "Tepat inilah yang akan dikirimkan — tidak ada yang lain, dan tidak ada yang disembunyikan. Kata sandi, token, dan kunci API Anda tidak ada di dalamnya."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:204
msgid "The diagnostics report that will be sent"
msgstr "Laporan diagnostik yang akan dikirim"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:207
msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "Salin ke papan klip"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:214
msgid "Send this report to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Kirim laporan ini ke dukungan Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:216
msgid "We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself."
msgstr "Kami membuka tiket dukungan untuk Anda dan membalas melalui email. Jika Anda memilih untuk tidak mengirimkannya, salin di atas dan tempel sendiri ke dalam tiket."

#. translators: %s: the transport error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:270
#, php-format
msgid "We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong."
msgstr "Kami tidak dapat menjangkau Zinn Digital® dari server ini (%s). Salin laporan di atas dan buka tiket sebagai gantinya — tidak ada yang salah dengan pengaturan Anda."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:284
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email."
msgstr "Terkirim. Dukungan Zinn® telah menerima laporan Anda dan akan membalas melalui email."

#. translators: %s: the support reference for the report just sent.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:287
#, php-format
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email."
msgstr "Terkirim. Dukungan Zinn® telah menerima laporan Anda — referensi %s — dan akan membalas melalui email."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:296
msgid "You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive."
msgstr "Anda telah mengirimkan beberapa laporan dalam waktu singkat. Tunggu beberapa menit dan coba lagi — laporan sebelumnya telah sampai."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:303
msgid "Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket."
msgstr "Zinn Digital® tidak dapat menerima laporan saat ini — masalah terjadi di pihak kami, bukan Anda. Silakan coba lagi beberapa saat lagi, atau salin laporan di atas ke dalam tiket."

#. translators: %d: the HTTP status code the server returned.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:311
#, php-format
msgid "The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number."
msgstr "Laporan ditolak (HTTP %d). Salin di atas dan buka tiket, dengan menyebutkan nomor tersebut."

#. translators: %s: the Zinn Digital trade mark, which is not translated.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:241
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:299
